{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aPONPON TOWN\u300b is a desktop idle game that you can play while you are doing other things! Collect over a dozen adorable marble animal villagers, gather resources, and build your village\u2014all without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/00_common_en-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749112938\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf89 A brand-new idle bouncer experience<br>Watch your cute villagers roll around the screen, collecting coins, wood, and mysterious materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/01_zhuangji_en-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749112938\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1fCollect cute animals<br>Chubby hamsters, stinky piglets, and chill capybaras! Gather all the cute animal villagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/03_animals_zh-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749112938\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fEasy to create and build during work breaks<br>Casual and relaxing game atmosphere, make full use of your desktop space and build your own cute village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/02_unlock_zh-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749112938\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687170?t=1749112938","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687170?t=1749112938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/dc56d68aeb190dc328f4430a14f04b12ef98857a/ca